    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Burahimu wahala mchetu wanjina, yeihwa Ketura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketura wamvyarira Burahimu Zimurani, Jokishani, Medani, Midiani, Ishibaki na Shuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokishani wakala isengbwa wa Sheba na Dedani; uvyazi wa Dedani kala ni Aashuri, Aletushi na Aleumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana a Midiani kala ni Efa, Eferi, Hanoki, Abida na Elidaa. Aho osi kala ni atu a chivyazi cha Ketura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Burahimu wamrisiza Isaka malize zosi arizokala anazo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ariphokala achere moyo, waapha zawadi anae alume a anachetue na achiausa aphiye tsi ya mlairo wa dzuwa kpwa asisagale na mwanawe Isaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Burahimu waishi miaka gana mwenga na mirongo sabaa na mitsano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achifwa, naye kala akakala mtumia sana. Achizikpwa phamwenga na akaree. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anae Isaka na Isimaili amzika ndani ya pango riihwaro Makipela, mundani mwa Efuroni, mwana wa Sohari, Muhiti, phephi na Mamre, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.23.3+GEN.23.4+GEN.23.5+GEN.23.6+GEN.23.7+GEN.23.8+GEN.23.9+GEN.23.10+GEN.23.11+GEN.23.12+GEN.23.13+GEN.23.14+GEN.23.15+GEN.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 23:3–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "munda ambao Burahimu kala akaugula kpwa Ahiti. Osi Burahimu na mchewe Sara azikpwa phapho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya chifo cha Burahimu, Mlungu wamjaliya mwanawe Isaka. Hiyu kala asagala phephi na Beeri-Lahai-Roi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ni maneno kumuhusu Isimaili mwana wa Burahimu na Hagari, Mmisiri, ambaye kala ni mtumwa mchetu wa Sara, mkpwaza Burahimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ni madzina ga ana alume a Isimaili, mwana mvyere kala ni Nebayothi, na anjina kala ni Kedari, Adibeeli, Mibusamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mishima, Duma, Masa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadi, Tema, Jeturi, Nafishi na Kedema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano ndio anangbwa a Isimaili na gano ndigo madzina gao kahi ya midzi yao, na kambi zao, vilongozi kumi na airi kulengana na mbari zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isimaili kala ana miaka gana mwenga mirongo mihahu na sabaa ndipho achifwa na kuzikpwa phamwenga na akaree. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivyazivye vyasagala Havila hadi Shuri uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa wa Misiri kuphiya Ashuru. Aha asagala kanda na atu anjina a chivyazi cha Burahimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ni madzina ga atu a chivyazi cha Isaka, mwana wa Burahimu. Burahimu wamvyala Isaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka ariphokala ana miaka mirongo mine walóla Rebeka, mwana wa Bethueli, Muaramu kula Padani-Aramu na ni ndugungbwa mchetu wa Labani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka wamvoya Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa kukala mchewe kala ni tasa. Mlungu achimsikira na mchewe Rebeka achigbwira mimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimba iyo yakala ni ya patsa, na hinyo ana achikala anasukumana mo mwakpwe ndanini. Achiamba, “Kpwa utu wani mambo higa ganahendeka kpwangu?” Hipho wakpwendamuuza Mwenyezi Mlungu manage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
